WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.230
In 449 Yazdegerd II
of Sasanian Persia

2
00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:08.956
commanded the Armenians
to renounce Christianity.

3
00:00:08.996 --> 00:00:11.706
In 450 much of Armenia rose,

4
00:00:11.746 --> 00:00:14.136
led by Vardan Mamikonian.

5
00:00:14.376 --> 00:00:18.490
In 451 the armies met
on the plain of Avarayr.

6
00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.517
Vardan fell there,
and the field was lost.

7
00:00:21.757 --> 00:00:23.147
Yet the faith held:

8
00:00:23.187 --> 00:00:27.143
in 484 his nephew Vahan
won freedom of worship.

9
00:00:27.383 --> 00:00:30.274
Stand where Vardan stood.

